WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.300
Place your key light at an angle.

00:00:02.260 --> 00:00:05.300
Turn off the overhead lamp. Turn off

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:08.320
the overhead lamp. Keep the light two

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:11.100
feet away. Do not point it into

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.780
your eyes. Add a white reflector beside

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:16.680
you. Check the shadows on your face.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.720
Check the shadows on your face. Lock

00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:24.820
the exposure before recording. Save this lighting

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:25.200
setup.